    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf hwa ænigum preoste ænig woh beode, beon ealle geferan mid biscopes filste georne ymbe þa bote 7 beon to ælcan rihte, swa swa hit awriten is, quasi cor unum et anima una.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone offer wrong to any priest, all his colleagues are to be zealous about obtaining the compensation with the help of the bishop, and in every matter of law, they are to be, just as it is written, "as if one heart and one soul".</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone inflicts harm on any priest, all of his fellows—with the bishop's help—are to be persistent about the compensation, and in every legal matter they are to be, just as it is written, as one heart and one soul.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
